    "slug": "outsourced-helpdesk-customer-checkpoint-reliability-study",
    "title": "Customer checkpoint reliability: do promised help desk updates arrive with a real next action?",
    "excerpt": "A field study of customer checkpoint reliability, with test cases, evidence rules, metrics, authority boundaries, and buyer acceptance.",
    "published": "2026-10-08",
